  "summary": "Senior Software Developer with more than 15 years of experience specializing in network communications. Strong programming background in object-oriented design and implementation as well as software development best practices. A supportive and highly energetic  professional with top-notch organizational and follow-up skills as well as the ability to handle multiple tasks in an efficient manner that meets goals. Self-motivated with unusually strong analytical professional seeking a position with a dynamic company that can use my skills and talents.\n\nSpecialties: OOD, Design Patterns, C/C++, Tcl/Tk, WinDbg, STL, Boost, Visual Studio.NET",
